#: simcontrols.js:302
msgid ""
"Addition of more Fe<sup>3+</sup> ions results in more Fe(CNS)<sup>2+</"
"sup>complex. Hence the</br>colour intensity of red solution increases and "
"the equilibrium shifts</br>in the forward direction."
msgstr ""
"Addition of more Fe<sup>3+</sup> ions results in more Fe(CNS)<sup>2+</"
"sup>complex. Hence the</br>colour intensity of red solution increases and "
"the equilibrium shifts</br>in the forward direction."

#: simcontrols.js:306
msgid ""
"Addition of more [Co(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>2+</sup> results in "
"more (CoCl<sub>4</sub>)<sup>2-</sup> complex.</br>Hence the intensity of "
"blue colour increases and the equilibrium</br>shifts in the forward "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"Addition of more [Co(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>2+</sup> results in "
"more (CoCl<sub>4</sub>)<sup>2-</sup> complex.</br>Hence the intensity of "
"blue colour increases and the equilibrium</br>shifts in the forward "
"direction."

#: simcontrols.js:310
msgid ""
"Addition of more [Cu(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>2+</sup> results in "
"the formation of more</br>(CuCl<sub>4</sub>)<sup>2-</sup> and the "
"equilibrium shifts in the forward direction."
msgstr ""
"Addition of more [Cu(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>2+</sup> results in "
"the formation of more</br>(CuCl<sub>4</sub>)<sup>2-</sup> and the "
"equilibrium shifts in the forward direction."

#: simcontrols.js:316
msgid ""
"Addition of more CNS<sup>-</sup> ions results in more Fe(CNS)<sup>2+</"
"sup>complex. Hence the</br>colour intensity of red solution increases and "
"the equilibrium shifts</br>in the forward direction."
msgstr ""
"Addition of more CNS<sup>-</sup> ions results in more Fe(CNS)<sup>2+</"
"sup>complex. Hence the</br>colour intensity of red solution increases and "
"the equilibrium shifts</br>in the forward direction."

#: simcontrols.js:319
msgid ""
"Addition of more Cl<sup>-</sup> ions results in more (CoCl<sub>4</"
"sub>)<sup>2-</sup> complex. Hence the</br>intensity of blue colour increases "
"and the equilibrium shifts</br>in the forward direction."
msgstr ""
"Addition of more Cl<sup>-</sup> ions results in more (CoCl<sub>4</"
"sub>)<sup>2-</sup> complex. Hence the</br>intensity of blue colour increases "
"and the equilibrium shifts</br>in the forward direction."

#: simcontrols.js:323
msgid ""
"Addition of more Cl<sup>-</sup> ions results in the formation of more "
"(CuCl<sub>4</sub>)<sup>2-</sup></br>and the equilibrium shifts in the "
"forward direction. "
msgstr ""
"Addition of more Cl<sup>-</sup> ions results in the formation of more "
"(CuCl<sub>4</sub>)<sup>2-</sup></br>and the equilibrium shifts in the "
"forward direction. "

#: simcontrols.js:329
msgid ""
"Addition of K<sup>+</sup> ions affects the dissociation of KCNS and decrease "
"the</br>concentration of CNS<sup>-</sup>, as a result the equilibrium shifts "
"towards</br>backwards and the intensity of red colour decrease."
msgstr ""
"Addition of K<sup>+</sup> ions affects the dissociation of KCNS and decrease "
"the</br>concentration of CNS<sup>-</sup>, as a result the equilibrium shifts "
"towards</br>backwards and the intensity of red colour decrease."

#: simcontrols.js:333
msgid ""
"Addition of H<sub>2</sub>O results the formation of pink colour (CoCl<sub>4</"
"sub>)<sup>2-</sup>.</br>Hence the colour of the solution turns to pink and "
"the equilibrium shifts</br>in the backward direction."
msgstr ""
"Addition of H<sub>2</sub>O results the formation of pink colour (CoCl<sub>4</"
"sub>)<sup>2-</sup>.</br>Hence the colour of the solution turns to pink and "
"the equilibrium shifts</br>in the backward direction."

#: simcontrols.js:337
msgid ""
"Addition of water results in the formation of more [Cu(H<sub>2</"
"sub>O)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>2+</sup></br>and the equilibrium shifts in the "
"backward direction. "
msgstr ""
"Addition of water results in the formation of more [Cu(H<sub>2</"
"sub>O)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>2+</sup></br>and the equilibrium shifts in the "
"backward direction. "

